<h3>Supported keys and user actions</h3>

<div class="kd-text kd-text-secondary">

    <h3>Managing Focus</h3>

    <h3>Tree List</h3>
    <p>
        The Tree List implements the keyboard navigation specification for a TreeList component. You can refer
        to <a href="https://demos.telerik.com/blazor-ui/treelist/keyboard-navigation" target="_blank">TreeList - Keyboard Navigation</a>
        for its supported shortcuts.
    </p>
</div>

<h3>Timeline</h3>
<ul class="keyboard-legend">
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Home</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to first task.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">End</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to the last task.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Up Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to previous task.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Down Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            moves focus to next task.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Left Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            scrolls the view to the left.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Right Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            Scrolls the view to the right.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Enter</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            opens the popup edit form to provide editing of the task.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Delete</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            the task gets deleted.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Alt/Opt(Mac)</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Left Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            the task is collapsed, if it contains child tasks.
        </span>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="button-preview">
            <span class="key-button">Alt/Opt(Mac)</span>
            +
            <span class="key-button">Right Arrow</span>
        </span>
        <span class="button-descr">
            the task is expanded, if it contains child tasks.
        </span>
    </li>
</ul>
